│ network      │  Vector match threshold                    [ 0.30 ]           │
│ marketplace  │  #routing.searchThreshold  ⧉ copy link                        │
│ advanced     │                                                               │
├──────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 2 unsaved changes · routing.nameSeparator, retention.activityDays            │
│                                          [Revert all]  [Save changes]        │
