● on a section = that section has unsaved edits (nav shows dirt, not just the footer).
Search typed -> the nav is replaced by flat results across ALL sections, each row
  labelled with its section; Enter navigates + flashes the setting.
Deep link  /settings/routing#routing.searchThreshold -> scrollIntoView + 1.2s ring flash.
Dirty      one diff object vs the fetched value; PATCH sends ONLY the diff.
Navigate-away with dirt -> react-router useBlocker -> dialog
  [Discard changes] [Keep editing] [Save and continue]  (focus-trapped, Esc = keep editing).
Danger settings require a second click ("Save" -> "Confirm rename of 312 tools").
Empty search: "No setting matches `foo`." + a link to /docs/settings.
Error on PATCH: footer turns red, keeps the diff, shows the field-level zod message
  under each offending control. Nothing is lost.
